  "details": "Bit of an odd request, but it'd be a really interesting feature to be able to have your voice register on your end, just enough to generate and send viseme data, but your voice isn't actually sent.\n\nRegardless of mute settings, your mic is still tracked, so this seems to be possible.\n\nThe benefit would e to allow people to better lip-sync or have improved combination facial tracking and visemes, but they may still not want to be directly heard.",
